sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant S as Sender
    participant R as Empty replica
    participant C as Nodes closest to the DID
    S->>R: STORE(key, version N)
    Note over R: no record for key, so it cannot check<br/>version N against the version before
    opt record not in form, or not bound to key
        R-->>S: InvalidRecord (nobody asked)
    end
    R->>C: FindHash(key), all of them at once, deadline 2 s
    C-->>R: seq and SHA-256 of their record, or closer nodes
    alt version 0 (R2): a quorum claims a later version, or one holds another version 0
        R-->>S: NewerClaimed or Conflict (nothing verified or stored)
    else version N >= 1 (R5): one answer is enough to refuse
        Note over R: a later version: NewerClaimed<br/>another version N, a version N-1 that is not its prev,<br/>or a version older than N-1: Conflict
        R-->>S: NewerClaimed or Conflict (nothing verified or stored)
    else no refusal, and every node asked answered
        opt version N >= 1
            R->>C: FindValue(key) to the nodes that answered N-1 and prev
            C-->>R: version N-1
            Note over R: its hash is prev and it commits to the key of version N<br/>votes: holders of N and confirmed N-1, 13 of 19 at k = 20<br/>for version 1, one confirmed version 0 is enough
        end
        Note over R: verify the signature,<br/>then insert if still absent
        R-->>S: Stored
    else a node did not answer, nobody to ask, or too few votes
        Note over R: refuse: fail-safe default
        R--xS: no answer, the sender counts it unavailable
    end
